{"task_id": "Mbpp/65", "solution": "from collections.abc import Iterable\ndef recursive_list_sum(nested_list: list) -> (int | float):\n    \"\"\"\n    Flattens an arbitrarily nested list and sums all its numeric (int or float)\n    elements. Non-numeric elements, strings, and bytes are ignored.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for element in nested_list:\n        if isinstance(element, (int, float)):\n            total_sum += element\n        elif isinstance(element, Iterable) and not isinstance(element, (str, bytes)):\n            total_sum += recursive_list_sum(list(element))\n    return total_sum"}
