{"task_id": "Mbpp/71", "solution": "def comb_sort(data: list) -> None:\n    \"\"\"\n    Sorts a list of elements in-place using the Comb Sort algorithm.\n    Elements are sorted in ascending order.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(data)\n    if n <= 1:\n        return\n\n    gap = n\n    shrink_factor = 1.3\n    swapped = True\n\n    while gap > 1 or swapped:\n        if gap > 1:\n            gap = int(gap / shrink_factor)\n        \n        swapped = False\n        for i in range(n - gap):\n            if data[i] > data[i + gap]:\n                data[i], data[i + gap] = data[i + gap], data[i]\n                swapped = True"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/71", "solution": "def comb_sort(data):\n    \"\"\"Sorts a list of comparable elements in-place using the Comb Sort algorithm.\n    The list is sorted in ascending order.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(data)\n    if n <= 1:\n        return\n\n    SHRINK_FACTOR = 1.3\n    gap = n\n    swapped = True\n\n    while gap > 1 or swapped:\n        gap = int(gap / SHRINK_FACTOR)\n        if gap < 1:\n            gap = 1\n\n        swapped = False\n        for i in range(n - gap):\n            if data[i] > data[i + gap]:\n                data[i], data[i + gap] = data[i + gap], data[i]\n                swapped = True"}
