{"task_id": "Mbpp/96", "solution": "def divisor(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the number of positive divisors for a given integer.\n    It implements an efficient square root iteration algorithm.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    limit = int(number**0.5)\n    for i in range(1, limit + 1):\n        if number % i == 0:\n            if i * i == number:\n                count += 1\n            else:\n                count += 2\n    return count"}
