{"task_id": "Mbpp/100", "solution": "def next_smallest_palindrome(num: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the next smallest palindrome strictly greater than the given integer.\n    It iteratively checks numbers starting from `num + 1` until a palindrome is found.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def is_palindrome(n: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if an integer is a palindrome.\"\"\"\n        return str(n) == str(n)[::-1]\n\n    current_num = num + 1\n    while not is_palindrome(current_num):\n        current_num += 1\n    return current_num"}
