{"task_id": "Mbpp/131", "solution": "def reverse_vowels(input_string: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Reverses only the vowels in a given string, keeping consonants in place. 'y' is not considered a vowel.\"\"\"\n    VOWELS_SET = {'a', 'e', 'i', 'o', 'u'}\n    \n    char_list = list(input_string)\n    vowel_indices = []\n    vowels_found = []\n\n    # Iterate to find and collect all vowels and their original positions.\n    for i, char in enumerate(char_list):\n        if char.lower() in VOWELS_SET:\n            vowel_indices.append(i)\n            vowels_found.append(char)\n\n    # Reverse the collected vowels.\n    vowels_found.reverse()\n\n    # Replace the characters at the vowel positions with the reversed vowels.\n    for i, vowel_char in zip(vowel_indices, vowels_found):\n        char_list[i] = vowel_char\n\n    return \"\".join(char_list)"}
