{"task_id": "Mbpp/140", "solution": "from typing import List, Tuple, Union, Set\ndef extract_singly(list_of_lists: List[Union[List[int], Tuple[int, ...]]]) -> Set[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Flattens a list of lists (or tuples) into a single set of unique numbers.\n    Returns a set containing all unique numbers from the input.\n    \"\"\"\n    result_set: Set[int] = set()\n    for inner_iterable in list_of_lists:\n        for number in inner_iterable:\n            result_set.add(number)\n    return result_set"}
