{"task_id": "Mbpp/160", "solution": "def find_solution(a, b, n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds integer solutions (x, y) for the linear Diophantine equation ax + by = n.\n    Returns a tuple (x, y) if a solution exists, otherwise returns None.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def _gcd(x, y):\n        \"\"\"Calculates the greatest common divisor of two integers.\"\"\"\n        while y:\n            x, y = y, x % y\n        return abs(x)\n\n    def _extended_gcd(x, y):\n        \"\"\"Applies the Extended Euclidean Algorithm to find g, x_coeff, y_coeff such that x*x_coeff + y*y_coeff = g.\"\"\"\n        if x == 0:\n            return y, 0, 1\n        g, x_coeff, y_coeff = _extended_gcd(y % x, x)\n        return g, y_coeff - (y // x) * x_coeff, x_coeff\n\n    if a == 0 and b == 0:\n        if n == 0:\n            return (0, 0)\n        else:\n            return None\n\n    if a == 0:\n        if n % b == 0:\n            return (0, n // b)\n        else:\n            return None\n\n    if b == 0:\n        if n % a == 0:\n            return (n // a, 0)\n        else:\n            return None\n\n    g, x0, y0 = _extended_gcd(a, b)\n\n    if n % g != 0:\n        return None\n\n    scale_factor = n // g\n    x = x0 * scale_factor\n    y = y0 * scale_factor\n\n    return (x, y)"}
