{"task_id": "Mbpp/222", "solution": "def check_type(data_tuple):\n    \"\"\"Checks if all elements in the given tuple have the same data type.\n    Returns True if all elements have the same type or if the tuple is empty, False otherwise.\"\"\"\n\n    if not data_tuple:\n        return True\n\n    first_element_type = type(data_tuple[0])\n    for element in data_tuple[1:]:\n        if type(element) != first_element_type:\n            return False\n    return True"}
