{"task_id": "Mbpp/237", "solution": "from collections import defaultdict\ndef check_occurences(input_list: list[tuple]) -> dict[tuple, int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts occurrences of tuples in a list, treating permutations as identical.\n    Returns a dictionary mapping canonical tuples to their frequencies.\n    \"\"\"\n    frequency_map: dict[tuple, int] = defaultdict(int)\n    for item_tuple in input_list:\n        # Canonicalize the tuple by sorting its elements.\n        canonical_form = tuple(sorted(item_tuple))\n        frequency_map[canonical_form] += 1\n    return dict(frequency_map)"}
