{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n: int) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the average of the cubes of the first n natural numbers.\n\n    Args:\n        n: A positive integer representing the number of natural numbers.\n\n    Returns:\n        The average of the cubes as a float.\n\n    Raises:\n        ValueError: If n is not a positive integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int) or n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input 'n' must be a positive integer.\")\n\n    sum_cubes = (n * (n + 1) // 2) ** 2\n    return float(sum_cubes) / n"}
