{"task_id": "Mbpp/440", "solution": "import spacy\nfrom typing import Optional, Tuple\nADVERB_POS_TAG: str = \"ADV\"\ndef find_adverb_position(sentence: str) -> Tuple[Optional[int], Optional[int], Optional[str]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Identifies the first adverb in a given sentence and returns its position and text.\n    Returns (None, None, None) if no adverb is found or the input is an empty string.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Process the sentence using the loaded NLP model.\n    # spaCy handles empty strings by returning an empty Doc object.\n    doc = _nlp_model(sentence)\n\n    # Iterate through tokens to find the first adverb.\n    for token in doc:\n        if token.pos_ == ADVERB_POS_TAG:\n            return token.idx, token.idx + len(token.text), token.text\n    \n    # Return (None, None, None) if no adverb is found in the sentence.\n    return None, None, None"}
