{"task_id": "Mbpp/478", "solution": "def remove_lowercase(input_string: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Removes all contiguous sequences of lowercase characters.\n    Non-lowercase characters are preserved in their original order.\"\"\"\n\n    result_chars = []\n    n = len(input_string)\n    i = 0\n\n    while i < n:\n        if input_string[i].islower():\n            # If a character is lowercase, skip it and all subsequent lowercase characters\n            while i < n and input_string[i].islower():\n                i += 1\n        else:\n            # If the character is not lowercase, add it to the result\n            result_chars.append(input_string[i])\n            i += 1\n\n    return \"\".join(result_chars)"}
