{"task_id": "Mbpp/773", "solution": "from typing import Optional, Tuple\ndef occurance_substring(main_string: str, sub_string: str) -> Optional[Tuple[str, int, int]]:\n    \"\"\"Locates the first occurrence of sub_string within main_string.\n    Returns (sub_string, start_index, end_index) if found, otherwise None.\n    \"\"\"\n    start_index = main_string.find(sub_string)\n    if start_index != -1:\n        end_index = start_index + len(sub_string)\n        return (sub_string, start_index, end_index)\n    return None"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/773", "solution": "from typing import Optional, Tuple\ndef occurance_substring(main_string: str, substring: str) -> Optional[Tuple[str, int, int]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the first occurrence and position of a substring within a main string.\n    Returns (substring, start_index, end_index) if found, otherwise None.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not substring:\n        # An empty substring is considered to occur at index 0 for any main_string.\n        return (substring, 0, 0)\n\n    try:\n        start_index = main_string.index(substring)\n        end_index = start_index + len(substring)\n        return (substring, start_index, end_index)\n    except ValueError:\n        return None"}
