{"task_id": "Mbpp/786", "solution": "from typing import Any, List\ndef right_insertion(sorted_list: List[Any], value: Any) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Locates the insertion point for a value in a sorted list using binary search.\n    The returned index maintains the sorted order upon insertion.\n    \"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = len(sorted_list)\n\n    while low < high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if sorted_list[mid] < value:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:\n            high = mid\n    return low"}
