{"task_id": "Mbpp/809", "solution": "def check_smaller(tuple1: tuple, tuple2: tuple) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if every element in tuple2 is strictly smaller than its corresponding element in tuple1.\n    Returns True if the condition holds for all elements, False otherwise (including different lengths).\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(tuple1) != len(tuple2):\n        return False\n\n    for i in range(len(tuple1)):\n        if tuple2[i] >= tuple1[i]:\n            return False\n    return True"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/809", "solution": "def check_smaller(tuple1: tuple, tuple2: tuple) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if every element in tuple2 is strictly smaller than its\n    corresponding element in tuple1. Assumes valid, same-length tuple inputs.\n    \"\"\"\n    for i in range(len(tuple1)):\n        if not (tuple2[i] < tuple1[i]):\n            return False\n    return True"}
